msgstr "Детальный технический чертеж."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE"
msgid "Such a rare and detailed drawing!"
msgstr "Какой необычный и детальный рисунок!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP"
msgid "This seems to have medicinal properties"
msgstr "Кажется, у него есть медицинское применение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Chemistry has altered it."
msgstr "Химия изменила его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a fungus."
msgstr "Это гриб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It is dormant this time of day."
msgstr "В это время дня он находится в спящем состоянии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "It requires hydration before it can fruit again."
msgstr "Чтобы он снова дал плоды, нужна гидратация."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARDS"
msgid "Roughly hewn wood boards."
msgstr "Грубо отесанные деревянные доски."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARON"
msgid "They appear to be used as fodder."
msgstr "Похоже, их используют для подпитки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR"
msgid "We best not underestimate that one."
msgstr "Этого лучше не недооценивать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT"
msgid "Where did this vessel come from?"
msgstr "Откуда взялось это плавсредство?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD"
msgid "Remnants of a life well lived."
msgstr "Останки былой роскоши."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "Not quite how mum used to make, but it smells superb!"
msgstr "Не совсем так, как готовила мама, но пахнет превосходно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "The expurgated version, but it has my favorite: Megascops kennicottii."
msgstr "Сокращенная версия, но в ней есть мои любимые:\nMegascops kennicottii."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "What could possibly go wrong?"
msgstr "Что могло пойти не так?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "A powerful tome of summoning."
msgstr "Целый фолиант с заклинаниями призыва."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "A tome of accelerated petrification."
msgstr "Том усиленного окаменения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "Dead plants tied together to help me aid living plants."
msgstr "Мертвые растения, связанные вместе, чтобы помочь мне спасти живые растения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "Warm milk in book form."
msgstr "Теплое молоко в форме книги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "Hard to put this one down. It's gripping, frankly."
msgstr "От нее трудно оторваться. Ужасно захватывающая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG"
msgid "It is a flat aerofoil."
msgstr "Плоский аэродинамический профиль."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BRUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BRUSH"
msgid "Microscopic barbs allow for optimal hair retrieval."
msgstr "Микроскопические зазубрины созданы для более оптимального удаления волос."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUGNET"
msgid "The tool of entomologists"
msgstr "Инструмент энтомологов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE"
msgid "At least someone's bundled up out here."
msgstr "По крайней мере, в комплекте не было кого-то еще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP"
msgid "Antibacterial wrapping for food preservation."
msgstr "Антибактериальное обертывание для сохранения продуктов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN"
msgid "A sentient lagomorph."
msgstr "Разумное зайцеобразное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "Reduced to ash."
msgstr "Обращено в пепел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT"
msgid "Camouflage"
msgstr "Камуфляж."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTER"
msgid "Lepidopterous lipids?"
msgstr "Чешуекрылые липиды?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "A colorful lepidopteran."
msgstr "Цветное чешуекрылое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "It is captured."
msgstr "Оно поймано."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN"
msgid "Who knew butterflies made such nice baked goods?"
msgstr "Кто бы мог подумать, что из бабочек получается прекрасная выпечка?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "Wings from a captured butterfly."
msgstr "Крылья пойманной бабочки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD"
msgid "Cathartes, of course."
msgstr "Катартес, разумеется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC"
msgid "A young barrel cactus."
msgstr "Молодой ферокактус пурпуровый."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED"
msgid "Desperate times, desperate measures."
msgstr "Отчаянные времена требуют отчаянных решений."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER"
msgid "Reminds me of Burroughs. A favorite at the library."
msgstr "Напоминает мне Эдгара Берроуза. Любимый раздел библиотеки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT"
msgid "I'm not sure it's been prepared properly."
msgstr "Не уверена, что это было правильно приготовлено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Delightfully devoid of spines."
msgstr "Восхитительно очищен от шипов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "Огонь почти погас."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "A camp fire."
msgstr "Костер."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Этот огонь горит с угрожающей интенсивностью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel."
msgstr "Этому огню требуется топливо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "A perfectly average fire."
msgstr "Идеально горящий костер."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Его можно перезажечь снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC"
msgid "Serinus canaria. A historically useful sentinel species."
msgstr "Serinus canaria. Исторически полезный вид дозорного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD"
msgid "Serinus canaria. We ought never enter a cave without one."
msgstr "Serinus canaria. Мы никогда не должны входить в пещеру без нее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED"
msgid "Oh, dear."
msgstr "О боже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG"
msgid "A festive bag for seasonal treats."
msgstr "Праздничная сумка для сезонных угощений."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANE"
msgid "I'm no rabologist."
msgstr "Я не коллекционирую палки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT"
msgid "Daucus carota. Edible, and delicious."
msgstr "Daucus carota. Съедобно и вкусно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED"
msgid "Daucus carota, roasted to perfection."
msgstr "Daucus carota, идеально прожарена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED"
msgid "Daucus carota is a root vegetable."
msgstr "Daucus carota является корнеплодом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "Seed of Daucus carota."
msgstr "Семена Daucus carota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING"
msgid "Can we have nothing decent?"
msgstr "Неужели в нас не осталось ни капли доброты?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT"
msgid "The destruction of knowledge is such a difficult thing to stomach."
msgstr "Мой желудок не переваривает уничтожение знаний."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah! A proper desk! Just look at the finish on that wood!"
msgstr "Ай! Надлежащий стол! Только взгляни на деревянную отделку!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOON"
msgid "A sort of a wildcat. Handsome fellow."
msgstr "Подвид дикой кошки. Красивый дружок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY"
msgid "Looks used up."
msgstr "Кажется, здесь уже ничего нет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "An excellent hollow for a den."
msgstr "Превосходное углубление для логова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT"
msgid "Not quite like Crockett's, but it'll do."
msgstr "Не совсем как у Крокетта, но мне подойдет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks as though it can be moved."
msgstr "Выглядит так, как будто его можно сдвинуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED"
msgid "We must clear the surrounding boulders first."
msgstr "Сначала нужно убрать камни вокруг."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA"
msgid "All of them are genetically identical."
msgstr "Все они генетически идентичны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT"
msgid "I do not believe this one can be restored."
msgstr "Я не думаю, что это можно восстановить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED"
msgid "Somewhat better."
msgstr "Уже кое-что получше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE"
msgid "The seeds must have fallen down a sinkhole."
msgstr "Семена, видимо, провалились в сливное отверстие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE"
msgid "The placement of that rock looks intentional."
msgstr "Выглядит так, будто этот камень там лежит не случайно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL"
msgid "Much too crowded for my liking."
msgstr "Как по мне, там слишком людно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps when I am better prepared."
msgstr "Возможно, позже, когда я буду готова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN"
msgid "The subterranean world awaits."
msgstr "Подземный мир ждет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS"
msgid "The passage has been obstructed."
msgstr "Проход был заблокирован."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL"
msgid "With all those people? It's bound to be cacophony."
msgstr "Со всеми этими людьми? Получится сплошная какофония."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps later."
msgstr "Возможно, позже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN"
msgid "Maybe I should go back up for some fresh air."
msgstr "Может, мне стоит подняться и подышать свежим воздухом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN"
msgid "A lovely ornamental plant."
msgstr "Милое декоративное растение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL"
msgid "It's mostly carbon and ash."
msgstr "В основном, это углерод и пепел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1"
msgid "The magician's unfinished projects?"
msgstr "Незаконченные работы волшебника?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2"
msgid "The magician's unfinished projects?"
msgstr "Незаконченные работы волшебника?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3"
msgid "The magician's unfinished projects?"
msgstr "Незаконченные работы волшебника?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER"
msgid "Quite expressive!"
msgstr "Довольно выразительно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "A decorative stone carving of a bishop chess piece."
msgstr "Декоративная резьба по камню на примере шахматной фигуры в виде слона."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "It seems magic is afoot."
msgstr "Похоже на магию в действии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
msgid "A replica of Canis lupis."
msgstr "Точная копия Canis lupis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
msgid "The sculptor clearly studied the creature closely."
msgstr "Скульптор явно как следует изучил это существо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "An anatomical study of those strange beasts."
msgstr "Образец для изучения анатомии этих странных зверей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "Artist's interpretation of mythical Diptera."
msgstr "Художественная интерпретация мифической Diptera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL"
msgid "The king is, by all measures, a liability to everyone on the board."
msgstr "С любой точки зрения, король несет ответственность за каждого на доске."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA"
msgid "It is a commonly held belief that art imitates life."
msgstr "Общепринято считать, что искусство подражает жизни."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "A knight, in service to the king. Or perhaps the queen."
msgstr "Рыцарь на службе у короля. Или, возможно, у королевы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
msgid "It seems magic is afoot."
msgstr "Похоже на магию в действии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE"
msgid "Bust of Alces canadensis."
msgstr "Бюст Alces canadensis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE"
msgid "In chess, the queen is by far the most strategically formidable."
msgstr "В шахматах королева, безусловно, имеет внушительное стратегическое значение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN"
msgid "Pawns that journey to the seat of power can be quite dangerous."
msgstr "Пешки, которые смогли сесть на трон, могут быть весьма опасными."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE"
msgid "I hope this does not have a bad influence on the children."
msgstr "Надеюсь, это не окажет дурное влияние на детей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC"
msgid "Represents the protective walls of the king's castle."
msgstr "Представляет собой защитные стены королевского замка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
msgid "It seems magic is afoot."
msgstr "Похоже на магию в действии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER"
msgid "A motile storage chest."
msgstr "Передвижной ящик для хранения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
msgid "Oculus Mysterium."
msgstr "Oculus mysterium."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
msgid "The oculus is inactive."
msgstr "Глаз неактивен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "The earthenware has been magically animated."
msgstr "Глина была волшебным образом оживлена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE"
msgid "Terra cotta earthenware."
msgstr "Терракотовые черепки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, how charmingly fearsome."
msgstr "Ах, просто диву даешься, как страшно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "An intricately crafted terra cotta statue."
msgstr "Искусно вылепленная терракотовая статуя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "Огонь почти погас."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "A rather strange, magical fire pit."
msgstr "Довольно странное, волшебное кострище."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Этот огонь горит с угрожающей интенсивностью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel."
msgstr "Этому огню требуется топливо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "A perfectly unusual fire."
msgstr "Превосходный необычный огонь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Его можно перезажечь снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "Огонь почти погас."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "A fire pit. It's chilly."
msgstr "Кострище. Он холодный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Этот огонь горит с угрожающей интенсивностью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel, whatever fuel it takes."
msgstr "Этому огню требуется топливо, какое бы топливо он ни использовал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "A fire. Of some kind."
msgstr "Огонь. Какого-то вида."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Его можно перезажечь снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E"
msgid "East."
msgstr "Восток."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "The coordinates remain unknown."
msgstr "Мои координаты остаются неизвестными."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N"
msgid "North."
msgstr "Север."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE"
msgid "Northeast."
msgstr "Северо-восток."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW"
msgid "Northwest."
msgstr "Северо-запад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S"
msgid "South."
msgstr "Юг."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE"
msgid "Southeast."
msgstr "Юго-восток."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW"
msgid "Southwest."
msgstr "Юго-запад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W"
msgid "West."
msgstr "Запад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE"
msgid "Mandragora officinarum, cooked in the name of discovery."
msgstr "Мандрагора официнарум, приготовлена во имя науки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT"
msgid "It is slightly more appetizing when cooked."
msgstr "Чуть более аппетитно в готовом виде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT"
msgid "It's still a little bit poisonous."
msgstr "Оно все еще немного ядовитое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT"
msgid "It is slightly more appetizing when cooked."
msgstr "Чуть более аппетитно в готовом виде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "Now it's truly derelict."
msgstr "Теперь он совсем непригоден."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "It's got a bit to go before it's ready."
msgstr "Нужно еще подождать, пока не приготовится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "Almost done!"
msgstr "Почти готово!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Supper time!"
msgstr "Время ужина!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "It looks derelict when it's not cooking something."
msgstr "Выглядит бесполезным, когда ничего не готовит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL"
msgid "A flexible torso appendage."
msgstr "Гибкий придаток туловища."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN"
msgid "Zea mays, a great staple food."
msgstr "Zea mays, отличный продукт питания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED"
msgid "Popped corn!"
msgstr "Воздушная кукуруза!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS"
msgid "These maize seeds will grow in many climates."
msgstr "Эти семена кукурузы будут расти в разных климатических условиях."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "A perfect hollow for nesting animals."
msgstr "Идеальная выемка для гнездования животных."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "What a darling Diptera juvenile!"
msgstr "Какой чудный птенец Diptera!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "How do you maintain flight, dear?"
msgstr "Как у тебя выходит летать, дорогуша?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "Now it feels like home."
msgstr "Создает чувство домашнего уюта."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "I could just squish that widdle face."
msgstr "Так бы и затискала это славное личико."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "What a handsome poult you are!"
msgstr "Какой же ты красивый!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "Who's the sweetest little Canis lupus?"
msgstr "Кто тут у нас самый сладкий малютка Canis lupus?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Corvus brachyrhynchos."
msgstr "Корвус брахиринхос."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "A perfectly handsome specimen."
msgstr "Замечательный представитель вида."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "Some grass cuttings."
msgstr "Немного срезанной травы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "This won't last long."
msgstr "Его надолго не хватит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Some rush cuttings."
msgstr "Немного срезанного камыша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Some smoothed rock slabs."
msgstr "Несколько отесанных каменных плит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "I'm not sure that's good to eat."
msgstr "Я не уверена, что это можно есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "Дерево горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Карбонизированное дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Плоды собраны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Fagales of some kind. It bears fruit when fully grown."
msgstr "Какой-то вид букоцветных. Плодоносит, когда полностью созреет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "That is no tree I've seen before!"
msgstr "Мне не доводилось видеть такого дерева прежде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Its antler has grown in for winter."
msgstr "Его рог растет в процессе зимы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "It has shed its antler for the warmer months."
msgstr "Он сбросил свой рог на период теплого времени года."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "Laurasiatheria!"
msgstr "Лауразитерия!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "I feel a vague sense of accomplishment."
msgstr "У меня легкое ощущение совершенства."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "It looks like a key, but it's quite brittle."
msgstr "Выглядит, как ключ, только довольно хрупкий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "The poor creature has been forcibly fused to a magic gem."
msgstr "Бедное создание было насильственно сплавлено с самоцветом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "A tuft of a graminoid."
msgstr "Злаковидный торф."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "Much more effective than reading glasses."
msgstr "Куда эффективнее, чем очки для чтения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "Unhygienic!"
msgstr "Негигиенично!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "The dial is moving faintly."
msgstr "Напряжение едва колеблется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a magitechnical homing device."
msgstr "Это волшебно-техническое приспособление, сделанное из рога."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "Here we are!"
msgstr "Вот оно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "This is definitely the right track."
msgstr "Это уже определенно правильный путь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "Must be getting close."
msgstr "Должно быть уже близко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It will need some work before it can function."
msgstr "Над ним нужно поработать, прежде чем он сможет функционировать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "It simply needs a key now."
msgstr "Здесь просто нужен ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "Ah. The beauty of functionality."
msgstr "Ай! Красота и функциональность."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "This rod could be useful!"
msgstr "Этот жезл может быть полезен!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "The longer the dragon, the better the luck."
msgstr "Чем длиннее дракон, тем больше удачи он принесет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "It's some kind of mythical variant of a Diptera."
msgstr "Какой-то мифический вариант двукрылых."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST"
msgid "Scales! Scales are the winner!"
msgstr "Чешуя! Чешуя — к удаче!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC"
msgid "A very efficient, magically powered furnace."
msgstr "Очень эффективная печь, работающая на магии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED"
msgid "Hm, that was an interesting choice of alteration."
msgstr "Хм, занятный способ деформации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH"
msgid "The magic of the two gems keeps it burning at maximum strength."
msgstr "Магия двух самоцветов заставляет ее работать с максимальной силой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL"
msgid "It is burning at half strength, presently."
msgstr "Сейчас она горит в пол силы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "Hylocereus undatus, or pitahaya blanca."
msgstr "Гилоцерус волнистый, или pitahaya blanca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED"
msgid "Pleasantly prepared pitahaya blanca."
msgstr "Приятно приготовленная pitahaya blanca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS"
msgid "A seed for the magnificently mild Hylocereus undatus."
msgstr "Семечко непередаваемо мягкого Hylocereus undatus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT"
msgid "This is the head to the dragon costume."
msgstr "Голова от костюма дракона."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE"
msgid "I do love a nice fruit pie."
msgstr "Я люблю хорошие фруктовые пироги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT"
msgid "This is the back of the dragon costume."
msgstr "Спина от костюма дракона."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES"
msgid "Scales from an insect? Unheard of!"
msgstr "Чешуя насекомого? Немыслимо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK"
msgid "A leg of poultry."
msgstr "Ножка птицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED"
msgid "Not terribly healthy, but my is it delicious!"
msgstr "Не очень здоровая пища, но, боже мой, как вкусно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Для выращивания необходима почва."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Для выращивания необходима почва."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Для выращивания необходима почва."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Для выращивания необходима почва."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Для выращивания необходима почва."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN"
msgid "Aha, the Durio zibethinus. It really does reek."
msgstr "Ага, Durio zibethinus. Он и впрямь дурно пахнет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking this certainly did not improve its odor."
msgstr "Его приготовление определенно не улучшило его запах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
msgid "Even the seeds of the Durio zibethinus smell a bit."
msgstr "Даже семена Durio zibethinus пахнут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT"
msgid "Poor Leporidae. At least it's warm."
msgstr "Бедный Leporidae. Ну, зато стало теплее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL"
msgid "It's an eel."
msgstr "Это угорь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED"
msgid "This eel has been cooked."
msgstr "Этот угорь был приготовлен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "A nightshade. Solanum melongena, specifically."
msgstr "Паслен. Вид Solanum Melongena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "For your enjoyment: Braised Solanum melongena."
msgstr "Для удовлетворения твоего любопытства: Тушеный Solanum melongena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "Seed of aubergine."
msgstr "Семя баклажана."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Well, such as it is."
msgstr "Что ж, так вышло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Ah, could use a doily, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr "Ах, можно использовать салфетку, не так ли?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "The more light to read by the better, in my opinion."
msgstr "Чем больше света для чтения, тем лучше, на мой взгляд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's pleasant to see a little decor out here."
msgstr "Приятно видеть хоть какой-то предмет декора здесь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It is Maxwell's turn to procure bulbs. I've it written down right here."
msgstr "Теперь очередь Максвелла делать лампочки. Я написала это прямо тут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "A pity. Shall we find replacements?"
msgstr "Очень жаль. Стоит найти замену?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "Дерево горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Карбонизированное дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Плоды собраны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A generically coniferous tree."
msgstr "Обычное хвойное дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "Дерево горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Карбонизированное дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Плоды собраны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "This genus seems to lack reproductive capabilities."
msgstr "Видимо, у этого рода растений проблемы с размножением."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "The cornea must be quite water-repellent."
msgstr "Видимо, роговица обладает водоотталкивающими свойствами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "I believe they are controlled by the larger plant."
msgstr "Полагаю, ими управляет более крупное растение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "The magic of the two beasts has been concentrated by the Thulecite."
msgstr "Магия двух зверей, объединенная тулецитом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "I'll need to place this."
msgstr "Мне нужно где-то это разместить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "It shan't grow a crop again."
msgstr "Здесь больше никогда не вырастут культурные растения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "A small cultivated patch of ground."
msgstr "Маленький возделанный участок земли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "The plants are extracting minerals from the ground."
msgstr "Растения добывают необходимые минералы из земли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "It has been rendered infertile for lack of nutrients."
msgstr "Он остался неудобренным из-за нехватка питательных веществ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "This will induce quite an airflow!"
msgstr "Это вызовет заметный приток воздуха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "Not quite the genuine article, but it might fool some birds."
msgstr "Вещь не совсем подлинная, но можно одурачить птиц."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "Oh, how I missed proper writing implements!"
msgstr "Ох, как я могла забыть про необходимые письменные принадлежности!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "Feather of Canaria."
msgstr "Перо Canaria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "Feather of Corvus."
msgstr "Воронье перо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "Feather of Cardinalis."
msgstr "Перо птицы вида Cardinalis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "It looks like a feather of Cardinalis, but white."
msgstr "Выглядит в точности, как перо Cardinallis, но только белое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "Poor girl."
msgstr "Бедная девочка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "A simply constructed fence."
msgstr "Забор обыкновенный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "That is a wooden gate."
msgstr "Это деревянные ворота."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "All the components for a wooden gate."
msgstr "Все необходимое для постройки деревянных ворот."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "All the components for a wooden fence."
msgstr "Все необходимое для постройки деревянного забора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "A bucket of animal feces. Pungent."
msgstr "Ведро фекалий животных. Вонючий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "Someone experienced with magic ought to wield this. Like myself!"
msgstr "Это может пригодиться тому, для кого магия — не пустой звук. Например, мне!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "A little too noisy for my liking."
msgstr "Слишком шумные, как по мне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "They disperse when I approach."
msgstr "Они разлетаются, когда я приближаюсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "Their bioluminescent properties might prove useful."
msgstr "Их биолюминесцентные свойства могут оказаться полезными."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "That hound is more dangerous than the others."
msgstr "Эта гончая опаснее остальных."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "Огонь почти погас."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "A fire pit."
msgstr "Кострище."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Этот огонь горит с угрожающей интенсивностью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel."
msgstr "Этому огню требуется топливо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "A perfectly average fire."
msgstr "Идеально горящий костер."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Его можно перезажечь снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "Some kind of fire-throwing contraption."
msgstr "Некое огнеметательное приспособление."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Fuel's getting low."
msgstr "Он гаснет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "Nothing to see here."
msgstr "Ничегошеньки тут нет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "Pitch that ice!"
msgstr "Бросай лед!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "Some kind of whitefish, I believe."
msgstr "Какая-то белая рыба, похоже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "I've read all about fishing. It should be a snap."
msgstr "Я прочла о рыбалке все. Это должно быть легко и просто."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "Give me some tartar sauce and I'm in heaven."
msgstr "Подлей мне немного соуса Тартар, и я буду на седьмом небе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Personally I relish a spot of spice on my fish."
msgstr "Лично я люблю рыбу со специями."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Beautifully grilled."
msgstr "Идеально поджарено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "A hard nodule of quartz."
msgstr "Твердая кварцевая порода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a wildflower. I'm unfamiliar with the species."
msgstr "Это дикорастущее растение. Мне не знаком данный вид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "Ah, a Rosa Macdub... what's it doing out here?"
msgstr "Ах, Rosa Macdub… что она тут делает?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "How celebratory."
msgstr "Как празднично."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "Plenty of nutrients!"
msgstr "Очень много питательных веществ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "You could read by that light."
msgstr "При таком свете можно читать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "It's not often one sees a flower with such a powerful aura."
msgstr "Нечасто увидишь цветок с такой мощной аурой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "This flower lacks the essentials for growth."
msgstr "Этому цветку недостает главных веществ для роста."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "These may have some nutritional value."
msgstr "У этого может быть питательная ценность."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "Protective gear for full-contact endeavors."
msgstr "Защитное снаряжение для полноконтактных устремлений."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "Hardened remains preserved by taphonomic processes."
msgstr "Огрубевшие останки, застывшие в процессе тафономии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "Oh! A specimen fit for a museum!"
msgstr "О! Этот экземпляр подходит для музея!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "Paleontological incompetence has produced a sad excuse for a creature."
msgstr "Палеонтологическая некомпетентность породила печальное оправдание для этого существа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "There are pieces of the skeleton still yet to be assembled."
msgstr "Еще не все части скелета были собраны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "Considered a delicacy in some countries."
msgstr "В некоторых странах считается деликатесом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "A amphibian tetrapod."
msgstr "Четвероногая амфибия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's sleeping."
msgstr "Кажется, он спит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "It was an interesting choice to serve it as a sandwich."
msgstr "Неплохой идеей было положить их в сэндвич."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "They're still twitching a bit."
msgstr "Они все еще немного дергаются."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "Not unlike a chicken wing."
msgstr "Не слишком отличается от куриных крылышек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "What a nice selection of fruit!"
msgstr "Какое чудесное сочетание фруктов!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Fur from a Bearger."
msgstr "Мех медведя-барсука."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "Completely petrified as a result of lunar exposure."
msgstr "Полностью окаменелый в результате лунного воздействия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "Lunar light catalyzes a strange reaction in its skin."
msgstr "Лунный свет вызывает странную реакцию в его коже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "Various cogs and wheels."
msgstr "Разнообразные зубья и колеса."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "These hold gems."
msgstr "Здесь есть самоцветы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "What a strange effect."
msgstr "Какой странный эффект."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "It must be fake. I don't believe it."
msgstr "Должно быть, это обман. Я в это не верю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "Oh goodness, how lovely!"
msgstr "Ох, боже мой, какая прелесть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "Wrapping presents is soothing work, isn't it?"
msgstr "Упаковывание подарков успокаивает, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "I always loved glass sculptures."
msgstr "Я всегда любила стеклянные скульптуры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "Careful, it's sharp."
msgstr "Осторожнее, острая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER"
msgid "A bizarre specimen of the insecta class."
msgstr "Причудливый образец из класса насекомых."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "It's gone gray, but it's still dripping."
msgstr "Он стал серым, но с него все еще капает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's dripping with goo."
msgstr "С него капает жижа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "It appears to be quite volatile."
msgstr "Кажется, оно довольно нестабильно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "The pennons of that strange specimen."
msgstr "Крылья этого странного вида."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "Tantalizing!"
msgstr "Соблазнительно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "I can't imagine these improving visibility."
msgstr "Не могу представить, как они улучшают видимость."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this chops."
msgstr "Самый мягкий из металлов, но давайте посмотрим, как он справляется с рубкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this mines."
msgstr "Самый мягкий из металлов, но давайте посмотрим, как он проявит себя в горных работах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this tills."
msgstr "Самый мягкий из металлов, но давайте посмотрим, как он справляется с возделыванием земли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this digs."
msgstr "Самый мягкий из металлов, но давайте посмотрим, как он будет копать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "A small lump of gold. Atomic number 79."
msgstr "Небольшой кусок золота. Атомное число — 79."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "Soft body down! It makes me wish I could sleep."
msgstr "Какая мягкая форма! От него мне хочется спать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "It needs poop."
msgstr "Нуждается в удобрении."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "Combustion!"
msgstr "Возгорание!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "It's afflicted with an agrarian disease beyond my curing."
msgstr "Он подвергся аграрному заболеванию без моего ухода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Hm... There are spots of discoloration here."
msgstr "Хм… В этих местах трава уже выцвела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "A cluster graminoid stalks."
msgstr "Пучок побегов злаковых."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "I think it will grow back."
msgstr "Думаю, оно вырастет заново."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "It can't survive in this hot climate."
msgstr "В этом жарком климате оно не выживет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It appears to be infected by some unknown pathogen."
msgstr "Кажется, он заразился каким-то неизвестным патогеном."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "I've never encountered this species before. Seems harmless."
msgstr "Я никогда раньше не сталкивалась с этим видом. Выглядит безобидно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "A dainty parasol that will provide moderate protection."
msgstr "Изысканный зонт, дающий умеренную защиту от солнца."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "Works almost as a magical binding agent."
msgstr "Работает почти как магический связующий агент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "Chromium impurities have colored this gem green."
msgstr "Примеси хрома окрасили этот камень в зеленый цвет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "That should help us keep our bearings."
msgstr "Это должно помочь нам не сбиться с пути."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "It appears to rewind time on an object."
msgstr "Видимо, поворачивает для объекта время вспять."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "Seems edible, though it may not be totally sane to consume it."
msgstr "Выглядит съедобно, однако употреблять это в пищу будет весьма безрассудно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Chemistry has altered it."
msgstr "Химия изменила его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a fungus."
msgstr "Это гриб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It is dormant this time of day."
msgstr "В это время дня он находится в спящем состоянии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "It requires hydration before it can fruit again."
msgstr "Чтобы он снова дал плоды, нужна гидратация."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "I always made guacamole for science day at the library."
msgstr "Я всегда делаю гуакамоле на День Науки в библиотеке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "More metabolic byproduct."
msgstr "Снова отходы метаболизма."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Knowledge is power!"
msgstr "В знании — сила!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "Remember to eat in moderation, children."
msgstr "Не забывайте, есть нужно в меру, дети."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "How darling!"
msgstr "Какая прелесть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "I fear I've a terrible weakness for a spot of chocolate."
msgstr "Боюсь, у меня ужасная слабость к шоколаду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "The candy itself is quite pleasant, if unappealing in appearance."
msgstr "Эта конфета довольно приятная, если абстрагироваться от ее внешнего вида."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "There will be some sore jaws in the morning, I imagine."
msgstr "Боюсь, что утром меня ждет пара больных зубов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "A delightful ten on the Scoville scale."
msgstr "По шкале Сковилла, пойдет на десятку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Delightfully colored kernels of high fructose corn syrup."
msgstr "Чудесно красочные зерна кукурузы, приправленные сиропом с высоким содержанием фруктозы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Hmm, well, at least there's a healthy option on the table."
msgstr "Хм-м, что ж, по крайней мере, на столе есть здоровый аналог."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "I was always a fan of black licorice, myself."
msgstr "Я всегда была поклонником черной лакрицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "It almost seems a shame to eat them."
msgstr "Есть их как будто неудобно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "I'd prefer none of you eat these at all."
msgstr "Будет лучше, если никто из вас не будет их есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "I'll take the ones you don't want, dears."
msgstr "Я возьму те, которые ты не захочешь есть, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "How darling!"
msgstr "Какая прелесть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "I had best not hear of any tummy aches later."
msgstr "Надеюсь, потом я не услышу ни о какой боли в животе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "This was perhaps not the most efficient use of resources."
msgstr "Не думаю, что это было самым эффективным использованием ресурсов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "A worker's tool."
msgstr "Рабочий инструмент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "That looks much too strenuous."
msgstr "Он прямо-таки пышет энергией."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "I prefer tweed."
msgstr "Я предпочитаю твид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "A natural disinfectant."
msgstr "Натуральный дезинфектор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "It is thankless work."
msgstr "Это неблагодарная работа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "It's a bit chilly."
msgstr "Немного прохладный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "Its temperature is below freezing."
msgstr "У него минусовая температура."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "Its temperature is totally unremarkable."
msgstr "Его температура ничем не примечательна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "It is warm enough to radiate heat and light!"
msgstr "Достаточно нагрелся, чтобы излучать тепло и свет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "It is retaining thermal energy. But only a bit."
msgstr "Он сохраняет тепловую энергию. Но в небольших количествах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "It's exuding powerful pheromones."
msgstr "От него исходят сильные феромоны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "A place to kick up one's feet."
msgstr "Место, где можно пустить корни."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Not much of an aid now."
msgstr "Не слишком много помощи теперь от него."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "A navigational aid. \"You are here\"."
msgstr "Помощь в навигации. \"Вы находитесь здесь\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "A chance to give direction."
msgstr "Возможность задать верный путь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Sweetened plant nectar."
msgstr "Подслащенный растительный нектар."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "Beeswax used for storing honey."
msgstr "Пчелиный воск, используемый для хранения меда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "Honey was the only sweetener used for this lovely ham."
msgstr "Мед — единственный подсластитель, который я использовала для этой ветчины."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "Bite-sized sweetened meat!"
msgstr "Подслащенное мясо на один укус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "What an excellent specimen! I can almost hear the beefalo."
msgstr "Какой прекрасный образец! Я почти слышу бифало!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Chili gives me indigestion."
msgstr "От чили у меня несварение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "That hound is not domesticated."
msgstr "Эта гончая неодомашнена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "The endoskeleton of Canis lupus, definitely not familiaris."
msgstr "Эндоскелет Canis lupus, точно не familiaris."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "Those bones are foreboding."
msgstr "Эти кости — дурной знак."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "Made of calcium and brimstone."
msgstr "Состоит из кальция и серы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "It emits a frequency undetectable to the human ear."
msgstr "Испускает сигналы на частоте, не воспринимаемой человеческим ухом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "Eons of subterranean evolution went into this widdle malformed monstrosity."
msgstr "Эра подземной эволюции пришла к этому уродливому чудищу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "Pygocentrus Nattereri."
msgstr "Pygocentrus Nattereri."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "Mortuus piscis."
msgstr "Mortuus piscis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "The solid state of water."
msgstr "Твердое состояние воды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "It is a crude heat exchanger."
msgstr "Это примитивный теплообменник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Nothing like a book and a bowl of ice cream."
msgstr "Что может быть лучше книги и вазочки с мороженым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "A perfect cube of ice."
msgstr "Идеальный кубик льда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "What a strange, cold beast."
msgstr "Какое странное холодное создание."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Perfectly insulated."
msgstr "Идеально изолирован."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "Some kind of ice-throwing contraption."
msgstr "Некое снегометательное приспособление."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I must be seeing things."
msgstr "Похоже, я что-то видела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "It appears to be a tiny pyramid."
msgstr "Это, кажется, маленькая пирамида."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "I'm aging like a fine, intelligent wine, am I not?"
msgstr "С возрастом я хорошею, как хорошее, изысканное вино, разве нет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "I'd love some toast to put this jam on. Oh well."
msgstr "Я бы намазала этот джем на тост. Ну, ладно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "Sweets, emulsified with beeswax."
msgstr "Сладости, эмульcированные пчелиным воском."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Meat on a stick, what next?"
msgstr "Мясо на палке, что дальше?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is especially venomous."
msgstr "Она особенно ядовита."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "It is not pleased."
msgstr "Она недовольна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "It uses its powerful olfactory sense to locate prey."
msgstr "Он использует мощные рецепторы обоняния, чтобы найти добычу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "Hmm. Quite a sturdy antler."
msgstr "Хм-м. Довольно крепкий олений рог."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "How curious."
msgstr "Как любопытно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "An automatic equine."
msgstr "Автоматическая лошадь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Its nightmare fueled surroundings have corrupted its programming."
msgstr "Топливо кошмара исказило в них программный код."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "Koalefanta Proboscidea."
msgstr "Коалефанта пробосцидея."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "Koalefanta Proboscidea in thick winter pelage."
msgstr "Koalefanta proboscidea в толстом волосяном покрове."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "It's a mythological holiday monster."
msgstr "Это мифологическое праздничное чудище."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "It seems bigger inside than out."
msgstr "Изнутри он кажется больше, чем снаружи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "A refuelable light source."
msgstr "Перезаправляемый источник света."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "Best for someone on the receiving end of harsh attacks."
msgstr "Лучший выбор для тех, на кого обрушиваются мощные удары."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "I'll leave that to one of the younger folks."
msgstr "Предоставлю это тем, кто помоложе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "Light, but not particularly protective."
msgstr "Легкий, но защищает не слишком-то хорошо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "The lightweight material grants the wearer better mobility."
msgstr "Благодаря легкому материалу, не затрудняет движений носителя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "This ought to prevent grievous harm from befalling the wearer."
msgstr "Это может отвести от носителя тяжелый урон."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "I can't say it would be much use to me."
msgstr "Вряд ли это может быть мне полезным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "A weave of magic replenishes the wearer's will."
msgstr "Напитанная магией ткань восполняет запасы энергии носителя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "That banner is invigorating nearby enemies."
msgstr "Этот флаг воодушевляет врагов поблизости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "Fascinating. It is animated, even here."
msgstr "Поразительно! Эта штука движется, как живая — даже здесь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "He has a chip on his shoulder, though I couldn't say why."
msgstr "У него на плече скол. Впрочем, откуда он — я не знаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "Goodness, I've no desire to wear such a thing."
msgstr "О боги, у меня нет ни малейшего желания это носить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "It is bound to our service."
msgstr "Это — наш долг."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "An enviable magic relic, I must say."
msgstr "Завидная магическая реликвия, скажу я вам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "A weak enchantment is present on this wreath."
msgstr "На этот венок наложены слабые чары."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "This will amplify the effects of incoming healing magic."
msgstr "Это усилит эффект поступающей целительной магии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "Proximity to the blossoms produces a restorative effect for the user."
msgstr "Близость зоны цветения имеет восстанавливающий эффект."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "It requires a key."
msgstr "Тут необходим ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "All ready for activation."
msgstr "Все готово к активации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "How brutish."
msgstr "Как жестоко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "Quite the unusual axe."
msgstr "Весьма необычный топор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It is linked to our Gateway, but inactive on this side."
msgstr "Эта штука привязана к нашим вратам, но с этой стороны — не активна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Well, this was an unexpected foray."
msgstr "Что ж, это было весьма неожиданное нападение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "A focal point for magical energies."
msgstr "Точка схождения магических энергий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "It seems to facilitate local teleportation."
msgstr "Похоже, это упрощает телепортацию в этой зоне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I'll leave that to someone a tad more spry."
msgstr "Пусть этим займется кто-нибудь попроворнее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "This strengthens the wearer's restorative magicks."
msgstr "Это усиливает восстанавливающую магию носителя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "I believe it is a larval dragonfly."
msgstr "Думаю, это личинка дракомух."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "A domestication opportunity, I'd say."
msgstr "Я бы назвала это одомашниванием."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "A large macrolecithal egg."
msgstr "Огромное макролецитальное яйцо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "The temperature of this egg is below optimal."
msgstr "Температура этого яйца ниже оптимальной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "This egg is at a suitable temperature for hatching."
msgstr "Температура этого яйца оптимальна для высиживания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "I have to admit it is rather appealing."
msgstr "Должна признать, выглядит довольно мило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "A healthy larval dragonfly."
msgstr "Здоровая личинка дракомухи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "This creature is hungry."
msgstr "Это существо хочет есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "This creature requires sustenance immediately!"
msgstr "Этому существу немедленно необходимо питание!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "An egg tooth used by a baby reptile to break out of its egg."
msgstr "Яйцевой зуб, используемый детенышем рептилии для вылупления."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "It's cooled down, almost like basalt."
msgstr "Она застыла, почти как базальт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "Its saliva is similar to molten lava."
msgstr "Слюна похожа на жидкую лаву."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "Molten rock. Best not to get too close."
msgstr "Расплавленный камень. Лучше не подходить слишком близко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "Recently cooled igneous rock. Dangerous."
msgstr "Остывший воспламеняющий камень. Опасный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "I... don't even know."
msgstr "Я… даже не знаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "I... don't even know."
msgstr "Я… даже не знаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "A symbiote! A fungus and a phycobiontic bacteria."
msgstr "Симбионт! Грибок и фикобионт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "The mold appears to have medicinal properties."
msgstr "У плесени есть и медицинское применение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "Is this animal or vegetable?"
msgstr "Это животное, или это растение?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Ah, a mechanical tool for fire starting. How useful."
msgstr "А, механическое приспособления для зажжения огня. Какая полезная вещица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Quite keen."
msgstr "Весьма проницательно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "A variant of Capra aegagrus, keen on electricity."
msgstr "Разновидность Capra aegagrus, зависящая от электричества."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "There must be something unnatural in the horn."
msgstr "В этом роге должно быть что-то неестественное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "Radiant electrical energy!"
msgstr "Излучает электрическую энергию!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "Highly conductive!"
msgstr "Отличный проводник!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "The juvenile is not as aggressive."
msgstr "Детеныш не настолько агрессивен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "This log is special."
msgstr "Это полено особенное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "This tree is special."
msgstr "Это дерево особенное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "An axial section of tree trunk. On fire."
msgstr "Осевая секция ствола дерева. Горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "An axial section of tree trunk."
msgstr "Осевая секция ствола дерева."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "Such a curious shape."
msgstr "Какая необычная форма."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "A perfectly fine looking axe."
msgstr "Идеально выглядящий топор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "Perhaps this species is surculose."
msgstr "Возможно, этот вид размножается побегами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "An invasive plant species."
msgstr "Особи растений агрессивного вида."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "Now it can be planted wherever is best."
msgstr "Его теперь можно посадить куда получше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "Poor boy."
msgstr "Бедняжка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Mandragora officinarum. Deceased."
msgstr "Mandragora officinarum. Погибло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "Mandragora officinarum, prepared as a soup in the name of discovery."
msgstr "Mandragora officinarum, использована в супе во имя науки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "Mandragora officinarum. But with a face."
msgstr "Mandragora officinarum. Только с лицом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "Mandragora officinarum, cooked in the name of discovery."
msgstr "Мандрагора официнарум, приготовлена во имя науки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "Mandragora officinarum."
msgstr "Mandragora officinarum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "They use their tails to balance."
msgstr "Они используют хвосты, чтобы удерживать равновесие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "The potential of the blank page is paralyzing for some."
msgstr "Некоторых одна мысль о пустых страницах уже парализует."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "A statuesque rock."
msgstr "Величественный камень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "Marble growth is arboriculturally impossible."
msgstr "Выращивание мрамора, как деревьев, невозможно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "I believe it's a perennial."
msgstr "Я полагаю, это многолетнее растение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "It shows the touch of a Roman artisan. How amazing."
msgstr "Видна рука римских мастеров. Как восхитительно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "Not ideal for topiary."
msgstr "Вряд ли это дерево можно будет красиво подстричь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "Amazing. A tree made entirely of marble."
msgstr "Восхитительно. Дерево, целиком состоящее из мрамора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Combustion!"
msgstr "Возгорание!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "A cluster of brambles."
msgstr "Куст ежевики."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Picking brambles is dangerous."
msgstr "Собирать ежевику опасно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "A swamp-dwelling rhizome."
msgstr "Приспособленное к болотам корневище."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Combustion!"
msgstr "Возгорание!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized mangrove."
msgstr "Карбонизированное мангровое дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been felled."
msgstr "Оно было срублено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A mangal rhizophora."
msgstr "Rhizophora mangle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL"
msgid "Get down from there this instant!"
msgstr "Ну-ка слезай оттуда немедленно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD"
msgid "I wish he wouldn't do that."
msgstr "Лучше бы он этого не делала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT"
msgid "How magical!"
msgstr "Как волшебно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK"
msgid "Now I just need a key."
msgstr "Теперь мне просто нужен ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH"
msgid "It appears to have no power source."
msgstr "Кажется, у него нет источника питания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE"
msgid "What an intimidating chair."
msgstr "Какой устрашающий стул."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEAT"
msgid "It's improper to eat it raw, but if we've no choice..."
msgstr "Есть его сырым неправильно, но если у нас нет другого выхода…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS"
msgid "A pile of processed meat. Who knows what went into this."
msgstr "Куча переработанного мяса. Кто знает, что входит в его состав."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT"
msgid "It doesn't seem stable."
msgstr "Она не кажется мне крепкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE"
msgid "The process has completed."
msgstr "Процесс завершен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING"
msgid "Dehydration is a slow process."
msgstr "Дегидратация — медленный процесс."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "The rain has temporarily halted the dehydration process."
msgstr "Дождь на время приостановил процесс дегидратации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC"
msgid "Meats can be dehydrated."
msgstr "Можно дегидрировать мясо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Salty, yet satisfying."
msgstr "Соленое, но вполне съедобное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERM"
msgid "A piscean biped!"
msgstr "Земноводное двуногое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "It's neither rotting nor fermenting now."
msgstr "Сейчас точно ни ферментирует, ни гниет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm uncertain whether it is rotting or fermenting."
msgstr "Не совсем уверена, ферментирует она или гниет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "On beyond dilapidated."
msgstr "Необратимо поврежден."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Obviously dilapidated."
msgstr "Очевидно, поврежден."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "This would make a great reading light."
msgstr "Из этого получится хорошая шапка для чтения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "Its aerodynamic principals are astonishing."
msgstr "Его аэродинамические свойства поистине выдающиеся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "An excellent diagram! Very accurate."
msgstr "Отличная схема! Сделано очень аккуратно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "A drawn diagram might help keep things tidy."
msgstr "Нарисованная схема поможет все расставить по полочкам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "Finally, a proper organizational tool."
msgstr "Наконец-то, правильный организационный инструмент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "Get away, you beast!"
msgstr "Уходи, зверь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "That chest is absolutely marvelous."
msgstr "Этот сундук совершенно бесподобен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "An amazingly large horn. I wonder if the nightmare helped fuel the growth."
msgstr "Удивительно большой рог. Интересно, способствовало ли топливо кошмара его росту."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "Ah, it's a Talpidae!"
msgstr "А, это Talpidae!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "I don't think my pocket is its natural habitat."
msgstr "Не думаю, что мой карман похож на его естественную среду обитания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Something is tunneling down there."
msgstr "Что-то роет внизу туннели."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "Ah, to look through another creature's, uh, nose!"
msgstr "А, можно смотреть сквозь, эм, нос другого создания!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "The tunnel system must be vast!"
msgstr "Система туннелей наверняка обширна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "They produce quite an odor."
msgstr "А от них попахивает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "This appears to be the home of several primates."
msgstr "А это похоже на дом для некоторых отдельных приматов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "Lasagna or no, it would be hazardous to consume it."
msgstr "Лазанья или нет, а употреблять это в пищу все еще опасно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "It would be hazardous to consume this."
msgstr "Употреблять это в пищу опасно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Salty, yet satisfying."
msgstr "Соленое, но вполне съедобное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "Ancient debris. Perhaps it can be restored?"
msgstr "Древние развалины. Возможно, их можно восстановить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "The magic of this structure ebbs in predictable cycles."
msgstr "Магия этой структуры убывает в определенных предсказуемых циклах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "The magic of the stone appears to be inexhaustible."
msgstr "Магия камня кажется неисчерпаемой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "Now we must be patient."
msgstr "Теперь нам нужно набраться терпения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "Hmm... It seems the staves are not interchangeable."
msgstr "Хм-м… Кажется, сюда подойдут только посохи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "It appears to lose functionality in subterranean conditions."
msgstr "Похоже, что они теряют функциональность в подземных условиях."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Something very odd is going on here."
msgstr "Здесь происходит что-то очень странное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "This cycle of the moon has drawn to a close."
msgstr "Этот цикл Луны подошел к концу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "The moon's cycle begins anew."
msgstr "Начался новый лунный цикл."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The moon is waning."
msgstr "Луна убывает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The moon is waxing."
msgstr "Луна прибывает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "Would make a useful cartographic instrument with proper embellishments."
msgstr "С нужными доработками это будет прекрасным картографическим инструментом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "Implications of a lunar body? Interesting."
msgstr "Вовлекает лунное тело? Интересно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "What a perplexing transformation."
msgstr "Какая сложная трансформация."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "I dub it Alces canadensis."
msgstr "Назову его Alces canadensis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "What a marvel!"
msgstr "Что за удивительный феномен!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "I should like to research its mating habits, someday."
msgstr "Я бы хотела когда-нибудь изучить особенности их спаривания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "A thirsty female Haemagogus Devorator."
msgstr "Голодная самка Haemagogus devorator."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "It is securely stored."
msgstr "Теперь она надежно упрятана."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "The stomach of a Culicidae, brimming with blood."
msgstr "Желудок Culicidae, наполненный кровью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "I suppose that's approximately what I expected."
msgstr "Полагаю, что это примерно то, чего я и ожидала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "A desecrated burial mound."
msgstr "Оскверненный могильный холм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "A burial mound."
msgstr "Могильный холм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "Hmm... This may require further reading."
msgstr "Хм-м… Об этом нужно подетальнее прочесть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "Quite functional, it operates as both an axe and a pickaxe."
msgstr "Довольно функционально. Работает как топор и как кирка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "Everyone, give the volatile Agaricus wide berth!"
msgstr "Все, держитесь на расстоянии от взрывоопасного Agaricus!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "Ooo. What a delightfully wizened look."
msgstr "О-о-о. Какой восхитительный высохший вид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "A towering, burnt Agaricus."
msgstr "Ужасный сожженный Agaricus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "We must destroy that towering Agaricus."
msgstr "Мы должны уничтожить этот ужасный Agaricus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "Carbonized by an exothermic chemical reaction."
msgstr "Обуглилось в процессе экзотермической химической реакции."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "It must first be seeded with a cut specimen or fungal spore."
msgstr "Сперва ее нужно засеять срезанным образцом или грибковой спорой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "An excellent fungal yield."
msgstr "Отличный грибковый урожай."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "The state of decomposition is too advanced to support any specimens."
msgstr "Процесс распада прогрессирует для подпитки любых образцов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "Its growth has been halted by the extreme cold."
msgstr "Дальнейшее выращивание невозможно из-за сильного холода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "The fungi are fruiting nicely."
msgstr "Грибы хорошо плодоносят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "We ought to pick them before they outgrow their planter."
msgstr "Мы должны собрать их до того, как они начнут расти еще больше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "That was myco-illogical. Ho ho!"
msgstr "Это было мико-нелогично. О нет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "A bioluminescent fungus. Neither Agaricales nor Xylariales."
msgstr "Биолюминесцентный гриб. Ни Agaricales, ни Xylariales."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "Quite enthralling, no?"
msgstr "Довольно захватывающе, разве нет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "Ahem. I'll be needing a new reading light."
msgstr "Кхм. Мне понадобится новый светильник для чтения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "Basic color theory is a must."
msgstr "Основное из теории цвета нужно знать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "Red and blue spores produce lovely reading light when combined."
msgstr "Если соединить красные и синие споры, получится прекрасный свет для чтения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "The smell is used to ward off predators."
msgstr "Запах, используемый для приманки хищников."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "A red variety of Mycena luxaeterna."
msgstr "Разновидность красной Mycena luxaeterna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "The light is caused by a chemical reaction."
msgstr "Свет вызван химической реакцией."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "My word! A huge Mycena silvaelucens."
msgstr "Боже мой! Огромная Mycena silvaelucens."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Apparently it's the breeding season for this species."
msgstr "Очевидно, у этого вида начался сезон размножения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A tree with a fungal parasite."
msgstr "Дерево с грибковым паразитом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED"
msgid "This relationship appears symbiotic."
msgstr "Похоже, это симбиотические отношения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "Curiously luminescent."
msgstr "Любопытное свечение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "Ectoplasmic residue."
msgstr "Остатки эктоплазмы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "The ancients seem to have used nightmare fuel to power everything."
msgstr "Древние, видимо, использовали топливо кошмара для питания всего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "The levels of ectoplasmic residue seem to be at their lowest."
msgstr "Уровень осадка эктоплазмы, кажется, почти на нуле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "There is very little ectoplasmic residue vapor."
msgstr "Испарений, содержащих осадок эктоплазмы, очень мало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "There doesn't seem to be any ectoplasmic vapor around here."
msgstr "Не наблюдаю вокруг испарений эктоплазмы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "The levels of ectoplasmic residue seem to be at their peak."
msgstr "Уровень осадка эктоплазмы, кажется, достиг пика."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "Levels of ectoplasmic residue are high but seem to be decreasing."
msgstr "Уровень осадка эктоплазмы высок, но, кажется, уменьшается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "There are low, but increasing levels of vapors containing ectoplasmic residue."
msgstr "Количество испарений, содержащих осадок эктоплазмы, низкий, но возрастает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "Levels of ectoplasmic residue seem to be increasing."
msgstr "Уровень осадка эктоплазмы, кажется, растет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "I wonder if it's named for Venus?"
msgstr "Интересно, он назван в честь Венеры?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "Transdimensional weaponry."
msgstr "Межпространственное вооружение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "Also known as saltpeter."
msgstr "Также известен как нитрат калия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE"
msgid "It could support a small ecosystem."
msgstr "Может поддерживать жизнь небольшой экосистемы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "An impressive improvement to the traditional pipe and tabor."
msgstr "Впечатляющее дополнение к традиционной волынке и барабану."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "A precious light diffracting mineraloid."
msgstr "Этот свет от драгоценного камня лишь отвлекает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "Appears to summon a cold star into being."
msgstr "Призван, чтобы привести холодную звезду в действие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "The gem fades with each use."
msgstr "С каждым использованием самоцвет тускнеет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "It looks like a Spessartite garnet."
msgstr "Похож на гранат Спессартит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "The fewer search parties we have to organize, the better."
msgstr "Чем меньше поисковых групп мы создадим, тем лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "Handy over small distances."
msgstr "На небольших расстояниях очень полезен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "An artifact which may contain other artifacts."
msgstr "Артефакт, в котором могут находиться другие артефакты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "Hollow reeds with harmonic resonance."
msgstr "Полый тростник с гармоническим резонансом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "Thin sheets of cellulose and lignin."
msgstr "Тонкие листы целлюлозы и лигнина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "A sentient Scorpiones. How odd."
msgstr "Разумные скорпионы. Как странно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "What a classy bird."
msgstr "Какая элегантная птица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "Nasty Meleagris, you stay away from those berries!"
msgstr "Противный Meleagris, убирайся прочь от этих ягод!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It's quite lovely."
msgstr "Весьма мило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized structure."
msgstr "Обугленная структура."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "A bush must be placed to attract the Meleagris."
msgstr "Для привлечения Meleagris нужно разместить кустарник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "The native Meleagris flock to it."
msgstr "Естество Meleagris тянется к нему."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "A wonderfully bland dumpling."
msgstr "Чудесные мягкие клецки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "Now it's a delightful handful of potpourri."
msgstr "Теперь это пригоршня приятной ароматической смеси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Interesting. These petals seem to have a mind of their own."
msgstr "Интересно. Похожи, эти лепестки живут своей жизнью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "Should make for an excellent building material."
msgstr "Должен получиться отличный строительный материал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "The congealed mucus retains its sticky texture."
msgstr "Замороженная слизь сохраняет липкую структуру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "A specialized axe for chipping away at rocks."
msgstr "Специальная кирка для разбивания камней."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "One of the warrior caste."
msgstr "Он из касты воинов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "A face only necessity could love."
msgstr "Лицо, которое можно полюбить лишь в случае крайней необходимости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "It's the charred remains of a head on a stick. Tsk!"
msgstr "Обуглившиеся останки головы на палке. Ай-яй!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "Tut tut. It's a head on a stick."
msgstr "Голова на палке. Вот только этого тут и не хватало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "The house had no fire-prevention system."
msgstr "У дома не было противопожарной системы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "I wonder what they do in there."
msgstr "Интересно, что же они там делают."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "The pig creatures have such prosaic taste in architecture."
msgstr "У свиноподобных созданий такой скучный архитектурный вкус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "That was quite rude."
msgstr "Это было весьма грубо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "He appears to be the leader of the village."
msgstr "Кажется, он главный в поселении."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "Don't worry, there are plenty more where that came from."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, там, откуда он пришел, есть еще такие же особи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "He seems to have bonded with me."
msgstr "Похоже, он ко мне привязался."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a semi-intelligent bipedal pig."
msgstr "Это полуразумная двуногая свинья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "It appears to be a guardian."
msgstr "Похоже, это охранник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "It's a lycanthropic pig."
msgstr "Это ликантропическая свинья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "The haunch of a semi-intelligent bipedal pig."
msgstr "Вырезка полуразумной двуногой свиньи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "Filthy."
msgstr "Грязно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "I wonder how it's fueled."
msgstr "Интересно, чем его заправлять."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "Conifer seeds encased in a mature strobilus."
msgstr "Семена хвойных, заключенные в оболочку шишки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "Conifer seeds approaching maturity."
msgstr "Семена хвойных подступают ко взрослой стадии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "Its design is effective at loosening earth."
msgstr "Конструкция способствует рыхлению земли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "The plant produced a meaty substance."
msgstr "Это растение производит мясную субстанцию."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "This looks much safer for consumption."
msgstr "Так выглядит более безопасно для употребления."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a... plant. Of some kind."
msgstr "Это… растение. Какого-то вида."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "It is not yet ready for harvest."
msgstr "Еще рано собирать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "It looks mature, now."
msgstr "Теперь оно выглядит зрелым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It couldn't survive the heat."
msgstr "Оно не пережило жару."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "That no good %s is up to no good."
msgstr "Нехороший %s замышляет что-то нехорошее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s, what have I told you about lighting fires?"
msgstr "%s, что я тебе говорила про игры с огнем?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, greetings dear %s!"
msgstr "Здравствуй, дорогой %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "Poor dear. %s needs a heart to anchor them to this plane."
msgstr "Бедняжка. %s нужно сердце, чтобы вновь оказаться на борту."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "I'll erase you from the history books!"
msgstr "Я сотру тебя из учебников по истории!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "I appreciate your commitment to group survival, %s."
msgstr "Я ценю твою преданность выживанию в команде, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "Punica granatum. Watery, sweet and a bit sour."
msgstr "Punica granatum. Сочный, сладкий и немного кисловатый."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "Punica granatum is so nice when it's warmed up."
msgstr "Punica granatum такой вкусный, когда разогретый."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Seeds of Punica granatum, separated from their arils."
msgstr "Семена Punica granatum, отделенные от ариллуса."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "A small but deep freshwater pond."
msgstr "Маленький, но глубокий пресноводный пруд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "It is a good thing this algae has no need for photosynthesis."
msgstr "Хорошо, что эта водоросль не нуждается в фотосинтезе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "A quantity of animal feces. How fragrant."
msgstr "Некоторые количество фекалий животных. Какой аромат."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "A potted plant."
msgstr "Растение в горшке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "The crowning achievement of the agricultural-industrial complex."
msgstr "Величайшее достижение сельскохозяйственно-промышленного комплекса."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "Cucurbita pepo."
msgstr "Cucurbita pepo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "Pumpkin biscuits, goody!"
msgstr "Тыквенное печенье. Сладости!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Cooked Cucurbita pepo. Gooey and delicious."
msgstr "Приготовленная Cucurbita pepo. Склизко и вкусно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "Carving the Cucurbita pepo is such a nice pastime."
msgstr "Вырезать узоры на Cucurbita pepo — такое приятное времяпрепровождение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "Pepitas."
msgstr "Семена тыквы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "I can almost sense it beckoning to something."
msgstr "Я практически ощущаю, как его тянет к чему-то."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "It gives off a strange aura."
msgstr "От него исходит странная аура."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "A tool to mark our whereabouts."
msgstr "Инструмент, который зафиксирует наше местонахождение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "That should tide it over while I prepare our next dish."
msgstr "Это позволит заморить червячка, пока я готовлю новое блюдо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "What is this \"Gnaw\", I wonder?"
msgstr "Интересно, что это за «Грызун»?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
msgid "A nice enough bullard."
msgstr "Симпатичный столб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
msgid "Something in the Hedera family."
msgstr "Что-то из рода плющовых."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
msgid "Impressive in scope."
msgstr "Впечатляющие масштабы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
msgid "Decrepit statuary."
msgstr "Ветхое святилище."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
msgid "A gruesome gargoyle."
msgstr "Ужасная горгулья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO"
msgid "Years past its life expectancy."
msgstr "Свое он уже отжил."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "Those berries need time to grow back. Time I don't have."
msgstr "Чтобы ягоды выросли снова, нужно время. Которого у меня нет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER"
msgid "There are so many uses for a bowl."
msgstr "Для чаши можно найти столько способов применения!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "Mutated seed of Daucus carota."
msgstr "Мутировавшие семена Daucus carota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
msgid "I do love a good casserole."
msgstr "Я люблю хорошие кастрюли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL"
msgid "Enough for one."
msgstr "Достаточно для одного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1"
msgid "Worth a paltry sum to the locals."
msgstr "Местные заплатят за это неплохие деньги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2"
msgid "A coin of some denomination."
msgstr "Монета определенного номинала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3"
msgid "A coin of some value."
msgstr "Монета определенной ценности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4"
msgid "It's made of a sort of condensed magic."
msgstr "Создано из какой-то сконцентрированной магии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT"
msgid "Raw Paralithodes meat."
msgstr "Сырое мясо животного рода Paralithodes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "It no longer presents a threat of salmonellosis."
msgstr "Угрозу сальмонеллеза он больше не представляет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP"
msgid "For trapping sea creatures."
msgstr "Для ловли морских жителей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN"
msgid "This species of fern is edible."
msgstr "Этот вид папоротника можно есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR"
msgid "Ground Triticum aestivum grain."
msgstr "Перемолотые зерна Triticum aestivum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED"
msgid "I believe we could have prepared it better."
msgstr "Думаю, можно было бы приготовить получше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "I suppose it's ready for the altar."
msgstr "Кажется, можно нести на алтарь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH"
msgid "The exact thing to placate the great wyrm."
msgstr "Идеальная вещь для умиротворения великого змея."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK"
msgid "It's the correct food, although an insufficient amount."
msgstr "Блюдо правильное, но его слишком мало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH"
msgid "Not the proper dish for the great wyrm."
msgstr "Неподобающее блюдо для великого змея."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT"
msgid "Completely carbonized."
msgstr "Полностью обуглилось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC"
msgid "Edible bulb of Allium cepa."
msgstr "Съедобный плод Allium cepa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Roast Allium cepa."
msgstr "Поджаренный Allium cepa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "Mutated seed of Allium cepa."
msgstr "Мутировавшее семя Allium cepa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID"
msgid "A sweet bipedal Bovidae adolescent."
msgstr "Славное, юное двуногое существо семейства полорогих."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK"
msgid "I shan't question its origins."
msgstr "Не стоит узнавать, откуда это взялось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM"
msgid "Perhaps she would be willing to barter."
msgstr "Может, она захочет обменяться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL"
msgid "Perhaps some barbeque is in order."
msgstr "Может быть, стоит устроить пикник?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM"
msgid "It needs to be on the ground."
msgstr "Это должно быть на земле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL"
msgid "Smaller than normal, but it'll do."
msgstr "Меньше обычного, но сойдет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM"
msgid "I need to put it down somewhere to use it."
msgstr "Чтобы это использовать, надо это куда-то поставить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE"
msgid "It can be used to till fertile soil."
msgstr "Этим можно разрыхлить плодородную почву."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY"
msgid "I shall have to see what this unlocks."
msgstr "Я пока не знаю, что он открывает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK"
msgid "I believe this is for the park."
msgstr "Полагаю, он от ворот парка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST"
msgid "What is it powered by, I wonder?"
msgstr "Интересно, что его питает?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT"
msgid "It's a nice enough light."
msgstr "Вполне приятное освещение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE"
msgid "For mechanically powdering our ingredients."
msgstr "Для механического измельчения наших ингредиентов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE"
msgid "Home of the local piscean bipeds."
msgstr "Домик местных рыбообразных двуногих."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1"
msgid "Reminds me of my bookmobile days."
msgstr "Вспомнились дни моей работы в передвижной библиотеке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2"
msgid "There are wares within."
msgstr "Там есть товары."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS"
msgid "I'm not familiar with the species, though it is edible."
msgstr "Мне не знаком данный вид, однако он съедобен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC"
msgid "A wild cluster of edible mushrooms."
msgstr "Дикая поросль съедобных грибов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED"
msgid "I don't think they'll grow back."
msgstr "Вряд ли они вырастут снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION"
msgid "Allium sativum, a close relative of Allium cepa."
msgstr "Allium sativum, близкий родственник Allium cepa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Roast Allium sativum."
msgstr "Жареный Allium sativum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "Mutated seed of Allium sativum."
msgstr "Мутировавшее семя Allium sativum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN"
msgid "It is best suited to baking sweets."
msgstr "Лучше всего подходит для выпечки сладостей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM"
msgid "All the parts are necessary to construct a fully functional oven."
msgstr "Чтобы собрать рабочую печь, нужны все детали."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE"
msgid "Wrought iron, it seems."
msgstr "Похоже, это кованое железо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL"
msgid "Quite an interesting sculpture."
msgstr "Весьма интересная скульптура."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2"
msgid "Rather ghoulish monument."
msgstr "Довольно жуткий памятник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN"
msgid "A pity. I always enjoyed a good fountain."
msgstr "Как жаль. Я всегда любила фонтаны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC"
msgid "We should have full access now."
msgstr "Теперь у нас есть свободный доступ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED"
msgid "It needs a key to open."
msgstr "Чтобы это открыть, нужен ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK"
msgid "I wish I could read the writing."
msgstr "Жаль, я не могу прочесть эту надпись."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN"
msgid "I wonder who's ashes those are."
msgstr "Интересно, чей это прах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB"
msgid "I should like to study its shell more closely."
msgstr "Надо тщательнее изучить его раковину."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD"
msgid "Deceased."
msgstr "Погибло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC"
msgid "An agreeable member of the Columbidae family."
msgstr "Приятный представитель семейства Columbidae."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It has entered the REM stage of sleep."
msgstr "Он вошел в фазу быстрого сна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER"
msgid "I did miss proper dishware."
msgstr "Мне не хватало хорошей посуды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT"
msgid "It is a natural spring of sodium-infused water."
msgstr "Это — естественный источник насыщенной натрием воды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL"
msgid "My suspicions were correct. It has more than one destination."
msgstr "Мои подозрения оправдались. Он ведет не в одну сторону."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY"
msgid "Quite an elaborate key."
msgstr "Довольно сложный ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT"
msgid "A larger pot takes longer to boil."
msgstr "Вода в большом котелке закипает дольше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO"
msgid "Solanum tuberosum, a staple in some cultures."
msgstr "Solanum tuberosum, основной продукт некоторых культур."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "Roasted Solanum tuberosum."
msgstr "Жареный Solanum tuberosum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Mutated seed of Solanum tuberosum."
msgstr "Мутировавшее семя Solanum tuberosum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER"
msgid "Traditionally one hangs a pot from it."
msgstr "На это, как правило, вешают котелки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM"
msgid "The old fashioned way to cook over a fire."
msgstr "Старомодный способ приготовления пищи на огне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL"
msgid "Hmmm, what shall we make next?"
msgstr "Хм, и что мы приготовим дальше?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP"
msgid "It needs sap."
msgstr "Нужен древесный сок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP"
msgid "The soil in this realm is fetid."
msgstr "Почва в этих краях зловонна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE"
msgid "Beyond repair."
msgstr "Ремонту не подлежит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE"
msgid "The remnants of a once thriving culture."
msgstr "Все, что осталось от некогда процветавшей культуры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL"
msgid "Interesting. It appears they didn't worship Gnaw."
msgstr "Интересно. Похоже, они не поклонялись Грызуну."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY"
msgid "Something must have knocked it down."
msgstr "Видимо, что-то разрушило этот дом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2"
msgid "It's crumbling."
msgstr "Она крошится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK"
msgid "Antiquated but not without sophistication."
msgstr "Старомодные, но исполнение интересное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER"
msgid "The clockwork has siezed as well."
msgstr "Эти часы отслужили свое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1"
msgid "What creatures once lived here?"
msgstr "Что за существа когда-то здесь жили?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2"
msgid "There's nothing left of the inhabitants."
msgstr "От жителей ничего не осталось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3"
msgid "What caused this city to crumble?"
msgstr "Что привело этот город в упадок?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR"
msgid "The door to a public house."
msgstr "Дверь в общественное заведение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF"
msgid "It has collapsed."
msgstr "Она обрушилась."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC"
msgid "This city's former inhabitants had stashed goods within."
msgstr "Прежние обитатели города хранили здесь свое добро."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED"
msgid "Surely there's an accompanying key."
msgstr "Конечно, где-то должен быть и ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON"
msgid "Mmmm! Oncorhynchus nerka!"
msgstr "М-м! Oncorhynchus nerka!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED"
msgid "Seared oncorhynchus nerka."
msgstr "Oncorhynchus nerka после термической обработки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT"
msgid "Sodium chloride. Also known as table salt."
msgstr "Хлорид натрия. Также известный как поваренная соль."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK"
msgid "Clusters of unprocessed sodium chloride."
msgstr "Скопления необработанного хлорида натрия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC"
msgid "Salt deposits should form on the rack soon."
msgstr "Скоро образуются кристаллы соли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY"
msgid "Enough salt has crystallized to harvest."
msgstr "У нас образовалось уже достаточно кристаллов соли для сбора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM"
msgid "We ought to put it up by the sodium spring."
msgstr "Это надо поместить в натриевый источник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP"
msgid "This tree sap has extraordinary glucose content."
msgstr "Сок этого дерева содержит невероятное количество глюкозы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET"
msgid "A simple implement for tapping trees."
msgstr "Обычное приспособление для сбора древесного сока."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING"
msgid "That's not growing back."
msgstr "Он уже не вырастет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED"
msgid "No longer food grade."
msgstr "Для употребления в пищу это уже не годится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "An envelope of potential crops."
msgstr "Конверт с потенциальными растениями."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL"
msgid "Gruesome."
msgstr "Жутко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND"
msgid "Processed and ready for cooking."
msgstr "Обработано, можно готовить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC"
msgid "I am not familiar with this species of plant."
msgstr "Этот вид растений мне незнаком."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED"
msgid "I don't have time to wait for it to grow back."
msgstr "Нет времени ждать, когда он снова вырастет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG"
msgid "It passes the universal edibility test."
msgstr "Он прошел универсальный тест на съедобность."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "What unique coloring. I should like to press its leaves in my books!"
msgstr "Какой неповторимый цвет! Хочу сохранить эти листья в своих книгах!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP"
msgid "I should at least like to study its rings."
msgstr "Надо хоть годичные кольца изучить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS"
msgid "The insecta are drawn to the glucose."
msgstr "Насекомых привлек аромат глюкозы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY"
msgid "Sap collection is under way."
msgstr "Добыча сока идет полным ходом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY"
msgid "No sense letting it sit."
msgstr "Нет смысла оставлять это здесь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED"
msgid "Its internal structure has been damaged, but it can still recover."
msgstr "Его внутренняя структура повреждена, но оно еще может восстановиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG"
msgid "What a magnificent subspecies!"
msgstr "Какой великолепный подвид!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Their society has stark social class roles."
msgstr "Для их общества свойственно четкое распределение социальных ролей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "It has entered the REM stage of sleep."
msgstr "Он вошел в фазу быстрого сна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE"
msgid "Tsk! What disrepair."
msgstr "Ц-ц-ц! Какая разруха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE"
msgid "This house is no longer livable."
msgstr "Этот дом жилым уже не назовешь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP"
msgid "A sweetener."
msgstr "Подсластитель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO"
msgid "Fruit of Solanum lycopersicum."
msgstr "Плод Solanum lycopersicum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "Roasted Solanum lycopersicum."
msgstr "Жареный Solanum lycopersicum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Mutated seed of Solanum lycopersicum."
msgstr "Мутировавшее семя Solanum lycopersicum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM"
msgid "They appear to have been quarantined. How foolish."
msgstr "Похоже, у них тут карантин. Как глупо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2"
msgid "They appear to have been quarantined. How foolish."
msgstr "Похоже, у них тут карантин. Как глупо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP"
msgid "Edible root of Brassica rapa."
msgstr "Съедобный корень Brassica rapa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED"
msgid "Roast Brassica rapa."
msgstr "Жареный Brassica rapa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS"
msgid "Mutated seed of Brassica rapa."
msgstr "Мутировавшее семя Brassica rapa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT"
msgid "Fresh Triticum aestivum."
msgstr "Свежий Triticum aestivum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS"
msgid "Mutated grain of Triticum aestivum."
msgstr "Мутировавшие зерна Triticum aestivum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC"
msgid "It's some kind of Lagomorph. With horns."
msgstr "Какой-то зайцеобразный. Но с рогами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD"
msgid "It is a cute widdle horned Lagomorph."
msgstr "Милый славный рогатый зайцеобразный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks like a small animal's burrow."
msgstr "Выглядит, как нора небольшого животного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING"
msgid "I hope the Lagomorph is all right down there!"
msgstr "Надеюсь, Lagomorph там внизу все еще в порядке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "It didn't even burn like a carrot."
msgstr "Он даже не горит, как морковь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Sadly, it is just painted to look like a carrot."
msgstr "К сожалению, он просто покрашен в цвет моркови."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT"
msgid "Totally non-porous."
msgstr "Абсолютно без пор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT"
msgid "I hate when my bun gets wet."
msgstr "Ненавижу, когда моя прическа намокает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT"
msgid "I can't read any measurements from that husk."
msgstr "Не могу снять никаких показаний с этого прибора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "Measure before you act."
msgstr "Семь раз измерь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE"
msgid "Nicoise, so nutritious!"
msgstr "Нисуаз, он так питателен!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAZOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAZOR"
msgid "A personal hygiene implement."
msgstr "Предмет личной гигиены."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDGEM"
msgid "It is warm."
msgstr "Он теплый."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN"
msgid "What a colorful little lantern."
msgstr "Какой красочный маленький фонарь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE"
msgid "The red lens will mark this position."
msgstr "Красная линза зафиксирует это положение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH"
msgid "The vibrant red hue is a sign of good luck."
msgstr "Яркий красный оттенок — это признак удачи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP"
msgid "Red usually indicates poison."
msgstr "Красный обычно обозначает ядовитый вид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Chemistry has altered it."
msgstr "Химия изменила его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a fungus."
msgstr "Это гриб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It is dormant this time of day."
msgstr "В это время дня он находится в спящем состоянии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "It requires hydration before it can fruit again."
msgstr "Чтобы он снова дал плоды, нужна гидратация."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
msgid "Combustion!"
msgstr "Возгорание!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC"
msgid "A group of juncaceae graminoids."
msgstr "Класс ситниковых злаков."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED"
msgid "I believe they shall grow back."
msgstr "Думаю, они вырастут снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST"
msgid "That could keep one moderately cool."
msgstr "В нем должно быть умеренно прохладно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RELIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RELIC"
msgid "A relic of an ancient civilization, lost to the ravages of time."
msgstr "Реликвия древней цивилизации, потрепанная беспощадным временем."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT"
msgid "I can't learn anything from a carbonized research station."
msgstr "Я не могу ничему обучиться на карбонизированной научной станции."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a research station. I can learn new things with it."
msgstr "Это научная станция. Я могу обучиться в ней новым вещам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT"
msgid "I can't learn anything from a carbonized research station."
msgstr "Я не могу ничему обучиться на карбонизированной научной станции."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a research station. I can learn new things with it."
msgstr "Это научная станция. Я могу обучиться в ней новым вещам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT"
msgid "An omen."
msgstr "Это предзнаменование."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps I have gone too far."
msgstr "Возможно, я слишком далеко зашла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT"
msgid "It won't be collecting any energy now."
msgstr "Сейчас она ничего не будет собирать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC"
msgid "I think the hat collects energy from the air."
msgstr "Думаю, эта шляпа собирает энергию из воздуха."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT"
msgid "It has been smote."
msgstr "Она уничтожена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC"
msgid "How very pagan."
msgstr "Это так по-язычески."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE"
msgid "That stone has regenerative powers."
msgstr "У этого камня есть возрождающая сила."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REVIVER"
msgid "This provides a corporeal anchor for the ectoplasmic configuration."
msgstr "Он создает связь между телесным и эктоплазмическим естеством."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Cardinalis! Beautiful plumage."
msgstr "Cardinalis! Прекрасное оперение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD"
msgid "This little fellow will be my friend."
msgstr "Этот добрый малый будет моим другом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
msgid "A winter coat for the Cardinalis? How peculiar!"
msgstr "Зимнее пальто для Cardinalis? Как необычно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD"
msgid "It's so delicate."
msgstr "Он такой нежный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
msgid "Poor child."
msgstr "Бедное дитя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK"
msgid "A large sedimentary rock."
msgstr "Большой осадочный камень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCKS"
msgid "A handful of assorted rocks."
msgstr "Горстка разнообразных камней."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCKY"
msgid "Their carapace is made of rocks."
msgstr "Их панцирь сделан из камней."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
msgid "A small block of extremely dense ice."
msgstr "Небольшой блок крайне плотного льда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED"
msgid "It must have melted due to its small size."
msgstr "Должно быть, он растаял из-за маленького размера."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED"
msgid "It must have melted due to its small size."
msgstr "Должно быть, он растаял из-за маленького размера."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "A capped lava pit."
msgstr "Прикрытый лавовый очаг."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
msgid "The cooling process has begun."
msgstr "Процесс охлаждения начался."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL"
msgid "Much too hot to touch."
msgstr "Слишком горячий, не прикоснуться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT"
msgid "Nothing but a sheath of igneous rock now."
msgstr "Теперь это всего лишь оболочка огненного камня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON"
msgid "Implications of a lunar body? Interesting."
msgstr "Вовлекает лунное тело? Интересно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "Should make for an excellent building material."
msgstr "Должен получиться отличный строительный материал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "Should make for an excellent building material."
msgstr "Должен получиться отличный строительный материал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "A clockwork castle."
msgstr "Механическая ладья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "It looks like it could break apart at any moment."
msgstr "Выглядит так, будто может развалиться в любой момент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "A short length of strong hemp rope."
msgstr "Крепкий, но короткий пеньковый канат."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG"
msgid "How unappetizing."
msgstr "Как неаппетитно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "In the wild this might have produced more queens."
msgstr "В дикой природе для его производства понадобилось бы больше маток."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "Looks like a job for library paste!"
msgstr "Похоже, здесь есть что подклеить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "A bit gaudy for my tastes, but it seems useful."
msgstr "Немного цветасто, на мой взгляд, но кажется весьма полезной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "An implement for administering devastating blows."
msgstr "Устройство для применения разрушительных ударов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "With a little elbow grease this could be put into working order."
msgstr "Немного физического труда — и будет в порядке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A small dimension tightly bound in magic."
msgstr "Маленькое измерение, крепко связанное магией."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "The magic's at work."
msgstr "Здесь не обошлось без магии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "A device for forceful unfurnishment."
msgstr "Устройство для принудительного снятия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "A crude device for equestrianism."
msgstr "Грубое приспособления для конного спорта."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "The decorative antennae are a lovely touch."
msgstr "Декоративные усики, приятные на ощупь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "A favorite perch of generals and assorted warlords."
msgstr "Любимое седло генералов и разного рода военачальников."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "A cube of sodium chloride to lure wild beasts."
msgstr "Куб хлорида натрия для привлечения диких животных."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Quite a phenomenal talent!"
msgstr "Просто феноменальный талант!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "Panthera auropunctata is misbehaving today."
msgstr "Panthera auropunctata сегодня плохо себя ведет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "Fascinating. I'll have to study these markings later."
msgstr "Очаровательно. Позже мне нужно будет изучить все эти метки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "It seems to have sunk into the soil."
msgstr "Похоже, его засосало в грунт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "Combustion!"
msgstr "Возгорание!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "It's afflicted with an agrarian disease beyond my curing."
msgstr "Он подвергся аграрному заболеванию без моего ухода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "Hm... Seems more brittle than is usual."
msgstr "Хм… Кажется более хрупким, чем обычно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a small tree."
msgstr "Это маленькое дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "Odd. I thought that would have killed it."
msgstr "Странно. Я думала, это убьет его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "The heat's gotten to it."
msgstr "Жара добралась до него."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "Hm. I suppose it was quite flammable."
msgstr "Хм. Полагаю, оно был легко воспламеняемым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Pity. He was such a jolly fellow."
msgstr "Жаль. Он был таким весельчаком."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, excellent. No more leaving clothes on branches to get wrinkled."
msgstr "Ах, превосходно. Больше не стану оставлять одежду на ветках, чтобы не помялась."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "You don't inspire a great deal of confidence, dear."
msgstr "Ты не внушаешь особого доверия, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "Oh, I never considered myself much of an artist!"
msgstr "Ох, я никогда не позиционировала себя, как живописец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "What a shame. It was a lovely addition."
msgstr "Какая жалость. Отлично дополнило картину."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "A method of ceramic production. We somehow use it for sculpture."
msgstr "Метод керамического производства. Каким-то образом мы используем его для создания скульптуры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "We were all in dire need of an emotional outlet, I believe."
msgstr "Я думаю, мы все остро нуждались в том, чтобы выплеснуть все эмоции."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "There's an almost animalistic ferocity in the chiselwork."
msgstr "В буровых работах присутствует какая-то животная дикость."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "An excellent repair job."
msgstr "Отличная ремонтная работа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "Something is stirring within."
msgstr "Что-то шевелится внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "So this is what was lurking inside."
msgstr "Так вот что было в скульптуре."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "I can lift it. I'm more spry than I look."
msgstr "Я могу ее поднять. Я намного проворнее, чем выгляжу на самом деле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Very tasteful."
msgstr "Сделано со вкусом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "The structure is whole once again."
msgstr "Структура снова целостна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "Something is stirring within."
msgstr "Что-то шевелится внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "They say every block of stone has a statue inside."
msgstr "Говорят, что у каждого камня есть статуя внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "You have to lift with your knees, dear."
msgstr "Ты должна встать с колен, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "I feel a light dusting of magic. Odd."
msgstr "Я чувствую небольшое присутствие магии. Странно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "We may want to keep an eye on this."
msgstr "Нам лучше не сводить с него глаз."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "Something is stirring within."
msgstr "Что-то шевелится внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "What an awful state it's in!"
msgstr "В каком ужасном состоянии она находится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "That's a thrown out back waiting to happen."
msgstr "Этот выброшенный фрагмент просто ждет своего часа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of unidentifiable seeds."
msgstr "Горстка неопознаваемых семян."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "A toasted embryonic plant treat!"
msgstr "Жареное лакомство из зародыша растения!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "Ah! A scrying orb."
msgstr "Ай! Гадальный шар."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "A simple implement for domestic tasks."
msgstr "Обычное приспособление для домашних нужд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "A high grade adhesive, good for small mends."
msgstr "Адгезивное вещество высокого качества, подойдет для небольших прорех."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "Well, I suppose we did need an extra set of hands... Hm."
msgstr "Ну, полагаю, здесь нам пригодится лишняя пара рук… Хм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "This... This is no child's magic."
msgstr "Это… Это не просто какие-то детские фокусы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "It's a shovel. Surely you've seen one before?"
msgstr "Это лопата. Вы же видели лопаты раньше?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "Frog skin must remain damp, or they will suffocate. Not that this one minds."
msgstr "Лягушачья кожа должна быть влажной, иначе они будут страдать. Не что чтобы это кого-то волновало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "It wasn't doing me much good anyhow."
msgstr "От него все равно было мало пользы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "I can barely sleep on a bed, nevermind the ground."
msgstr "Я едва могу спать на кровати, что уж говорить о земле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "Protein fiber extruded from an arachnid."
msgstr "Белковое волокно, выделенное из арахнид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON"
msgid "An incredibly well preserved human skeleton."
msgstr "Невероятно хорошо сохранившийся человеческий скелет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT"
msgid "It has a detrimental effect on the mortal mind."
msgstr "Оказывает губительный эффект на разум смертного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT"
msgid "%s's skeleton is a permanent reminder to be mindful around %s."
msgstr "Скелет %s будет являться постоянным напоминанием для %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE"
msgid "%s's skeleton is a permanent reminder to be mindful around %s."
msgstr "Скелет %s будет являться постоянным напоминанием для %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE"
msgid "%s's skeleton is a permanent reminder to be mindful around %s."
msgstr "Скелет %s будет являться постоянным напоминанием для %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT"
msgid "%s's skeleton is a permanent reminder to be mindful around %s."
msgstr "Скелет %s будет являться постоянным напоминанием для %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKETCH"
msgid "Detailed diagrams of a stone sculpture."
msgstr "Подробные схемы каменной скульптуры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST"
msgid "A container resembling a cranium."
msgstr "Емкость, похожая на череп."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB"
msgid "It's past your bedtime."
msgstr "Давно пора спать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "A classic example of symbiosis."
msgstr "Классический пример симбиоза."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "This must be useful for something."
msgstr "В некоторых случаях она может быть полезна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "This must be useful for something."
msgstr "В некоторых случаях она может быть полезна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "A mineral-devouring gastropod."
msgstr "Минералоядный брюхоногий моллюск."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "It provides protection."
msgstr "Это дает защиту."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "A gastropod pod."
msgstr "Убежище брюхоногих моллюсков."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "Their mucus is explosive for some reason."
msgstr "Их слизь по каким-то причинам взрывоопасна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "Pieces of the broken."
msgstr "Частички разбитого."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "A rather diminutive specimen of the class Aves."
msgstr "Весьма миниатюрная разновидность класса Aves."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "It requires sustenance."
msgstr "Ему необходимо питание."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Without sustenance, it will surely perish."
msgstr "Без питания он точно погибнет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "It's a small, raw piece of meat."
msgstr "Маленький кусочек сырого мяса."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "High sodium content."
msgstr "Высокое содержание натрия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "What a ruffian!"
msgstr "Вот негодяй!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "A rare variant of gastropod."
msgstr "Редкий представитель брюхоногих моллюсков."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "Ovis chalybs, and a right mean looking one at that."
msgstr "Ovis chalybs, да к тому же, выглядит весьма посредственно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "Ancient weapons technology."
msgstr "Оружие по древней технологии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "I fear I'll not be much use with that."
msgstr "Боюсь, в моих руках это особой пользы не принесет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "Such an ineffectual shape for a polearm."
msgstr "До чего бесполезная форма древка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "What a handsome hunting implement."
msgstr "Какое милое охотничье приспособление."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead."
msgstr "Он мертв."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "A large, carnivorous arachnid species."
msgstr "Огромная хищная разновидность арахнидов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "They appear to be nocturnal."
msgstr "Похоже, они охотятся ночью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "Fascinating. These spiders have a communal hive."
msgstr "Очаровательно. Эти пауки живут общиной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "A highly portable spider egg sack."
msgstr "Высокопортативный мешок с паучьими яйцами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "This gland secretes a mildly toxic venom."
msgstr "Эта железа выделяет слегка токсичный яд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "Psionic control to exert over spiders. Excluding the boy, of course."
msgstr "Псионический контроллер для оказания влияния на пауков. Исключая мальчика, конечно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "This is the source of the spider infestation."
msgstr "Это источник паучьей инвазии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "This is the source of the spider infestation."
msgstr "Это источник паучьей инвазии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "That must be the center of the hive-mind."
msgstr "Должно быть, это средоточение коллективного разума."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "Ah, this species of arachnid has adapted to life on the cave ceiling."
msgstr "Ага, эти арахниды приспособились к жизни на потолке пещеры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "An arachnid with a thick carapace."
msgstr "Паукообразное с крепким панцирем."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "An arachnid that spits projectiles."
msgstr "Арахнид, способный атаковать плевками."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "He gave his life for his queen."
msgstr "Он отдал жизнь за свою королеву."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "It appears to be of the warrior caste."
msgstr "Похоже, он из касты воинов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "A well deserved rest, no doubt."
msgstr "Заслуженный отдых, без сомнения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD"
msgid "It is heavy with bacteria."
msgstr "Она кишит бактериями."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "A bright red carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Ярко-красный носитель генетической информации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Я носитель генетической информации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A lovely green carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Прекрасный носитель генетической информации зеленого цвета."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Я носитель генетической информации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A soft blue carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Носитель генетической информации нежного синего цвета."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Я носитель генетической информации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "Some sort of self-contained aurora."
msgstr "Какое-то автономное светило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "Perhaps a larger staff would summon a larger star."
msgstr "Возможно, посох побольше может призывать и звезды побольше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "I've never seen a weather vane employed as a weapon."
msgstr "Никогда бы не подумала, что флюгер можно использовать, как оружие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "That was an underhanded trick!"
msgstr "Это был коварный трюк!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "Something devious is lurking in the shadows."
msgstr "Что-то коварное скрывается в тени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "A strange rock formation."
msgstr "Странное каменное образование."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Another stalagmite."
msgstr "Еще один сталагмит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "A mistake in need of correcting."
msgstr "Ошибка, которую нужно исправить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "We could have learned much from each other."
msgstr "Мы могли бы многому научиться друг у друга."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "The weaver's twisted creation."
msgstr "Закрученное творение паука."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Nope, just a statue."
msgstr "Нет, просто статуя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Is it petrified?"
msgstr "Это окаменелость?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "A simple statue."
msgstr "Просто статуя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "He's actually quite a sweet boy when you peel away the ego."
msgstr "На самом деле, он славный малый, если убрать его огромное эго."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "A Grecian-inspired sculpture of the muse Melpomene. Some liberties have been taken."
msgstr "Изваяние музы Мельпомены в эллинском стиле. Допущены некоторые вольности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "A Grecian-inspired sculpture of the muse Thalia. Some liberties have been taken."
msgstr "Изваяние музы Талии в эллинском стиле. Допущены некоторые вольности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "The rain may inadvertently turn it into a bird bath."
msgstr "Дождь может ненароком превратить ее в ванну для птицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "It has a variety of household uses."
msgstr "У этого есть несколько способов применения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "It tapers to a sharp point."
msgstr "Оно сужается до острия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "This will offer some protection from the sun."
msgstr "Это обеспечивает некоторую защиту от солнца."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "This aubergine has been cooked and packed with comestibles."
msgstr "Этот баклажан был нафарширован и приготовлен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "It will wither if not replanted."
msgstr "Он высохнет, если не пересадить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "Uniquely adapted to arid climates."
msgstr "Уникальным образом адаптируется к засушливому климату."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "I wonder how my garden is doing without me."
msgstr "Интересно, как там мой сад поживает без меня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKBOAT"
msgid "A shipwreck, looks to be useless."
msgstr "Кораблекрушение. Кажется, здесь я ничего полезного не найду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "This vest screams \"stylish, but well-read.\"."
msgstr "Этот жилет как бы кричит \"модная, но эрудированная\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "That's terrible for your teeth, dear."
msgstr "Они вредят твоим зубам, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "Magnus Avis, fully developed."
msgstr "Магнус авис, взрослая особь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "It requires incubation."
msgstr "Ему требуется инкубация."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "Full of cholesterol."
msgstr "Полно холестерина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "You will catch your death of cold!"
msgstr "От холода ты погибнешь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "Development appears to be progressing."
msgstr "Развитие прогрессирует."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "Exposure to temperature extremes may result in death."
msgstr "Подверженность высоким температурам может привести к смерти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "A watched pot never boils."
msgstr "Кто над чайником стоит, у того он не кипит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "We shall soon reap the fruits of our labors."
msgstr "Скоро мы пожнем плоды трудов своих."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "What a tremendous Magnus Avis egg!"
msgstr "Какое огромное яйцо Magnus avis!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "The nest is empty. Soon the cycle will begin anew."
msgstr "В гнезде пусто. Скоро цикл начнется вновь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "An adolescent avian."
msgstr "Птица-подросток."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Please keep your voice level to a minimum."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, сохраняй уровень своей громкости на минимуме."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "A very naughty bird!"
msgstr "Очень вредная птица!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "I don't think it's powered yet."
msgstr "Не думаю, что оно заряжено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "It looks to be ready."
msgstr "Кажется, устройство готово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "This machine can be used to travel between worlds."
msgstr "Эту машину можно использовать для путешествий между мирами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "This runestone has unique geometric properties!"
msgstr "У этого рунического камня уникальные геометрические свойства."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "The device needs to be activated."
msgstr "Устройство необходимо активировать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "The device is in a partial state of completion."
msgstr "Устройство в частичной стадии завершения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "An electrical charge regulator."
msgstr "Регулятор электрозаряда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "It applies basic mechanical principles."
msgstr "Он работает по базовым правилам механики."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "Neither fully organic nor inorganic!"
msgstr "Нельзя сказать, что она полностью органическая или неорганическая!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "A torus of alloys and wiring."
msgstr "Тороидальная структура сплавов и проводов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "The gem appears to focus the nightmare fuel."
msgstr "Похоже, самоцвет вбирает в себя топливо кошмара."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "It wasn't doing me much good anyhow."
msgstr "От него все равно было мало пользы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sleeping in there would give me a stiff neck."
msgstr "Если я там буду спать, у меня шея будет болеть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "A horror waiting in the mud."
msgstr "Ужас, обитающий в тине морской."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "Never grab the pointy end."
msgstr "Никогда не хватайся за острый конец."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Hmmm, reproductive organs."
msgstr "Хм-м-м, репродуктивные органы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "I wonder how they breed?"
msgstr "Интересно, как они размножаются?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "There's more of it below than above!"
msgstr "Больше находится снизу, чем над поверхностью!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "A tiny horror waiting in the mud."
msgstr "Крохотный ужас, обитающий в тине морской."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "It appears to be all connected somehow."
msgstr "Кажется, все это как-то связано между собой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "This seems to be an interesting, ectoplasmic residue-bearing variety of ziosite."
msgstr "Похоже, это интереснейший образчик цоизита с явным эктоплазменным следом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "These could be combined to make a bigger piece."
msgstr "Эти части можно соединить в один большой элемент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "We were its intended recipient."
msgstr "Мы должны были быть его реципиентом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "It has formed a dangerous symbiotic relationship with fungal spores."
msgstr "Это сформировало опасное симбиотическое взаимодействие с грибковыми спорами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "The symbiotic bond between toad and fungus has reached its apex."
msgstr "Симбиотическая связь между жабой и грибом достигла своего пика."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "The soil has been disturbed here."
msgstr "Здесь структура грунта была нарушена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "A new member of the Agaricus genus?"
msgstr "Новый член рода Agaricus?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "The growth needs a catalyst to breach the surface."
msgstr "Для роста необходим катализатор для разрушения поверхности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "How bourgeois."
msgstr "Как буржуазно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "An improvised handheld light."
msgstr "Импровизированный портативный свет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "The path is open."
msgstr "Путь открыт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It deconstructs the subject and reconstitutes them elsewhere."
msgstr "Он уничтожает объект и воссоздает его в другом месте."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "The bezoar's magic has been activated."
msgstr "Магия безоара активирована."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "A bezoar formed in the gut of a large beast."
msgstr "Безоар из желудка большого зверя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "Mmmm, natural!"
msgstr "М-м-м-м, вкус природы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "All brawn and no brain, I'm afraid."
msgstr "Боюсь, тут у нас сплошные мускулы, а ума — кот наплакал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "This is quite advanced technology."
msgstr "Это довольно продвинутая технология."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "A simple stick-and-basket trap."
msgstr "Простая ловушка вида палочка-и-корзина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "It's covered with a thin film of canine digestive fluid."
msgstr "Она покрыта тонкой пленкой собачьей пищеварительной жидкости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "A crude attempt at tricking me."
msgstr "Слишком очевидная попытка обхитрить меня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "The charred skeleton of a storage chest."
msgstr "Обуглившийся остов сундука для хранения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A storage chest."
msgstr "Сундук для хранения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Looks suspicious..."
msgstr "Выглядит подозрительно…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "The flora grows thick here."
msgstr "Здесь очень густая растительность."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREEGUARD"
msgid "Fascinating... it's become bipedal!"
msgstr "Поразительно… оно стало двуногим!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "What a lovely set of bottle washers! Too bad they're all melted."
msgstr "Какой чудесный набор бутылочных шариков! Жаль, что они сплавились."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "I don't appreciate the insinuation, dear."
msgstr "Я не приемлю намеков, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Ah, it's a scale replica of that mischievous robot."
msgstr "Ах, это масштабная копия вредного робота."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "A muscular hydrostat that's been sat near something hygroscopic."
msgstr "Мускульный гидростат, который был помещен в водопоглощающую среду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "What a positively, delightfully odd little lady."
msgstr "Какой милая, приятная и странная маленькая дама."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "I think it's quite lovely, despite the cracks left by age..."
msgstr "Думаю, выглядит довольно мило, несмотря на трещины, оставленные временем…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "In medieval chess, this piece was called the elephant."
msgstr "В средневековых шахматах, эта фигура называлась слоном."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "The groove in this piece symbolizes the bishop's ceremonial headwear."
msgstr "Желоб на этой фигуре символизирует церемониальный головной убор епископа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "This would be a practical eating utensil if it weren't bent."
msgstr "Если бы ее так не погнули, то ей вполне можно было бы пользоваться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "Beware of Greeks bearing gifts."
msgstr "Бойтесь Греков, дары приносящих."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "A good illustration of gyroscopic precession."
msgstr "Прямая иллюстрация гироскопической прецессии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "A fake membranophone."
msgstr "Поддельный мембранофон."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "An instrument of self-sufficiency."
msgstr "Прибор для самостоятельности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "I have an excellent meringue recipe."
msgstr "Я знаю замечательный рецепт безе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "My grandmother used to knit."
msgstr "Моя бабушка любила вязать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "It reminds me of home."
msgstr "Напоминает мне о доме."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "What a positively adorable kitty cat. Sigh."
msgstr "Какой милый и веселый котенок. Эх."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "What an unpleasant scent."
msgstr "Какой неприятный запах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "It appears to be a primitive cup fashioned from a tuber."
msgstr "Это похоже на примитивную кружку, сделанную из клубня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "I miss the comforts of home."
msgstr "Я скучаю по домашним удобствам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "It was once called the \"tower\", long ago."
msgstr "Когда-то давно это называлось \"башней\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "Calling it a \"castle\" is plainly incorrect."
msgstr "Назвать это \"замком\" было бы в корне неправильно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "Oh, I just love the bard."
msgstr "Ох, я обожаю бардов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "Knights are better pieces when they're active in the center."
msgstr "Кони — лучшие фигуры, когда они ходят в центре."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "In German it is referred to as the \"springer\"."
msgstr "В переводе с немецкого это будет звучать как \"прыгун\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "Oh, I got my hopes up for a nice crystal ball."
msgstr "Ох, я надеялась увидеть хороший хрустальный шар."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "A decorative arachnid adornment! How darling!"
msgstr "Декоративное украшение паукообразных! Какая прелесть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "The paw grants three wishes, with terribly ironic results. So the story goes."
msgstr "Лапка исполняет три желания, но в итоге очень зло подшучивает. Такова легенда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Odorless. I believe it may have been sugar water."
msgstr "Без запаха. По-моему, это была сладкая вода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "Dunk those in boiling water before wearing them, dear."
msgstr "Опусти их в кипящую воду прежде чем надеть, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Luckily it is much too brittle to inflict any real damage."
msgstr "К счастью, он слишком хрупкий, чтобы нанести реальный ущерб"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "This simply does not work right."
msgstr "Она попросту не так работает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "It appears to be an abandoned glove."
msgstr "Это обычная затерявшаяся рукавица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "What a positively, delightfully odd little fellow."
msgstr "Какой милый, превосходно странный маленький человечек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "What a cute little mollusk shaped scale!"
msgstr "Какая милая маленькая чешуйка моллюска!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "This does not seem like it came from this world."
msgstr "Не похоже, что это из этого мира."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "Goodness, it seems quite wistful."
msgstr "Боже, как же тоскливо смотрится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "Perhaps I ought to save it for Webber."
msgstr "Думаю, отнесу-ка я это Вебберу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "A waste of a unique flora specimen."
msgstr "Бессмысленная трата уникальной разновидности флоры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "What a curious device!"
msgstr "Какое любопытное устройство!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "What an odd contraption."
msgstr "Какое же странное изобретение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "This spacecraft looks to have inadequate thermal controls."
msgstr "Похоже, что на этом космическом судне не отвечающий требованиям температурный контроль."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "I do hope WX-78 is feeling alright."
msgstr "Надеюсь, WX-78 чувствует себя хорошо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "I think I'll keep this. I know someone who might like it."
msgstr "Думаю, я это оставлю. Я знаю, кому это понравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "It reminds me of my bathtub. I could use a long soak."
msgstr "Напоминает мне о моей ванной. Я могла отмокать там часами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "What a coincidence. My cardigan is missing a button!"
msgstr "Какое совпадение. Я как раз потеряла пуговицу на своем кардигане!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "Durable outerwear."
msgstr "Износоустойчиво."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "Ample protection against the elements."
msgstr "Достаточная защита от природных условий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "Unpalatable, but high in protein."
msgstr "Невкусно, но содержит много белка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "A utilitarian proboscis."
msgstr "Утилитарный хобот."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "A specimen of leather and fur."
msgstr "Экземпляр из кожи и меха."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "A dried collection of plant matter."
msgstr "Совокупность высушенной растительной материи."

