msgstr "Здесь внизу холоднее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN"
