msgstr "Возвращаемся к работе!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE"
