#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
