#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
