#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
