#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "Look so friendly and cuddly."
msgstr "Выглядит дружелюбно и приятно."

