#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
